### Transactions API. Postings need an officer token; reads also work for auditors; other roles get 403 / 4101.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5121
@token = <paste data.token from the login response>
@sourceAccountId = 1
@destinationAccountId = 2
@transactionId = 1

### Log in as an officer and copy data.token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "officer", "password": "<your password>" }

### Deposit. Idempotency-Key is optional: sending the same key again returns the first result and posts nothing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: DEP-001

{
  "accountId": {{destinationAccountId}},
  "amount": 10000,
  "description": "Cash deposit",
  "referenceNo": "DEP-001"
}

### Withdrawal (account-type rules: AllowWithdrawal, minimum balance, daily/monthly limits)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/withdrawal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": {{sourceAccountId}},
  "amount": 1000,
  "description": "Cash withdrawal",
  "referenceNo": "WD-001"
}

### Internal transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/internal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": {{sourceAccountId}},
  "destinationAccountId": {{destinationAccountId}},
  "amount": 2500,
  "description": "Internal transfer",
  "referenceNo": "TRF-001"
}

### Interbank transfer (stays Pending until complete or fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/interbank
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": {{sourceAccountId}},
  "otherBankId": 1,
  "destinationAccountNo": "OTHER-001",
  "beneficiaryName": "Beneficiary Name",
  "amount": 3000,
  "description": "Interbank transfer",
  "referenceNo": "IB-001"
}

### Interbank: gateway settled it (officer or manager)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/interbank/{{transactionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gatewayReference": "GW-001", "settlementReference": "ST-001" }

### Interbank: gateway rejected it -> sender refunded; returns the Reversal transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/interbank/{{transactionId}}/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gatewayReference": "GW-001", "reason": "Beneficiary account closed" }

### NRC transfer: sender pays cash (sourceAccountId null) or from an account; receiver collects at a branch
### (deliveryType "Branch" + pickupBranchId, see GET branches) or another bank ("OtherBank" + pickupOtherBankId).
### Save the returned data.id and data.pickupCode (shown only once).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/nrc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": null,
  "senderName": "Sender Name",
  "senderNrc": "12/ABC(N)123456",
  "senderPhone": "09123456789",
  "receiverName": "Receiver Name",
  "receiverNrc": "13/DEF(N)654321",
  "receiverPhone": "09987654321",
  "deliveryType": "Branch",
  "pickupBranchId": 1,
  "pickupOtherBankId": null,
  "amount": 4000,
  "description": "NRC transfer",
  "referenceNo": "NRC-001"
}

### NRC pickup at our branch: cash (destinationAccountId null) or into the receiver's account.
### 5 wrong codes block the transfer -> 4449; it can then only be cancelled
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/nrc-pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": {{transactionId}},
  "pickupCode": "123456",
  "destinationAccountId": null
}

### NRC collected at another bank: record that bank's payout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/nrc/{{transactionId}}/paid-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payoutReference": "KBZ-778" }

### Branches where NRC transfers can be collected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### NRC cancel -> sender refunded the way they paid (cash or account); returns the Reversal transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/transfer/nrc/{{transactionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Receiver did not collect" }

### List (newest first). All filters optional: accountId or accountNo, type, status, from, before (exclusive), page, pageSize
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?type=NrcTransfer&status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Destination banks for the interbank form
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/other-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail: header, account entries, NRC / interbank detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Account statement (newest first, balance after each entry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/accounts/{{sourceAccountId}}/statement?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
